<title>USA: McDonnell Douglas holders approve Boeing deal. [CORRECTED 12:25 GMT 26/7]</title>
<headline>McDonnell Douglas holders approve Boeing deal. [CORRECTED 12:25 GMT 26/7]</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>McDonnell Douglas Corp said Friday (corrects from Thursday) that shareholders at a special meeting approved the company's acquisition by Boeing.</p>
<p>About 75 percent of the outstanding shares were cast for the $15 billion transaction.</p>
<p>&quot;Our merger with Boeing represents the best, even the ideal, solution for the future, for our customers, teammates and shareholders,&quot; McDonnell Douglas Chairman John McDonnell told the special shareholders meeting here.</p>
<p>		((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
